# Eywa — Windsurf Rules

## Project

Production-grade Go framework for conversational AI agents. Strict hexagonal
architecture. 19 independent Go sub-modules, each with its own `go.mod`.

## Architecture — Hexagonal

```
channels/, fiber/          ← inbound adapters (Receptor, REST)
ports/                     ← interfaces only, zero implementation
internal/implementation/   ← domain logic, depends only on ports
internal/infrastructure/   ← outbound adapters
mongo/, redis/, providers/ ← sub-module adapters
```

**Hard rules:**
- `internal/implementation/` NEVER imports `internal/infrastructure/`
- `ports/` = interfaces only
- All dependencies injected via constructors
- Sub-modules never import each other — root `eywa` only
- New capability: port first → adapter → inject

